OL,3,GNEWSARepair funding of #249k secured
OL,4,Afor former library
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust that has taken over a Grade
OL,7,FII listed former library after a High
OL,8,FCourt battle has been awarded #249,000
OL,9,Fto help with its transition.
OL,11,FThe Garage Trust took over the Carnegie
OL,12,FBuilding in King's Lynn, Norfolk, in
OL,13,FApril 2026 and is transforming it into
OL,14,Fa performing arts venue.
OL,16,FIt is now called The Workshop King's
OL,17,FLynn and has already hosted community
OL,18,Farts events and professional
OL,19,Fperformances.
